\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.2}{\ignorespaces Pipeline\nobreakspace {}1, YOLO26 + ORB-SLAM3, as designed: stereo images and IMU are synchronised, tracked and passed to local mapping, loop closing and the Atlas map; the detector's boxes enter the tracking stage.}}{20}{figure.caption.34}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.3}{\ignorespaces Pipeline\nobreakspace {}2, YOLO26 + VINS + RTAB-Map, as designed: VINS tracking, initialisation and sliding-window optimisation produce odometry, RTAB-Map builds the map from that odometry and the stereo images.}}{20}{figure.caption.35}%
